stays home. There have been many years when I lurked
for December first.  The flood of sucky crap from
interlopers cut down participation a _lot_ this
year. Probably less than a dozen people contributed,
where in good years three dozen might have attempted
to avoid the ego crushingly deadly comment "FTFTS" -
"(your posting) failed to fail to suck".

My three were pretty grim, the last one marginally
in limits at best, but then I write them on the
spot. One fellow spent eight months on his, and it
